## POM STRUCTURE

A POM slide is: <Slide> -> one root layout container -> 2-4 content bands.
Root is EITHER <VStack w="1280" h="720" padding="P" gap="G"
alignItems="stretch" backgroundColor="$surface"> (horizontal bands, top-to-bottom)
OR <HStack w="1280" h="720" padding="P" gap="G"
alignItems="stretch" backgroundColor="$surface"> (full-height vertical splits, left-to-right).
Default to VStack. Use HStack root for full-bleed 50/50 or 60/40 column layouts.
The pipeline injects the <Theme> automatically - do NOT emit one.

NODE CATEGORIES:
  LAYOUT nodes: <VStack> (vertical), <HStack> (horizontal) - the skeleton.
    Attributes: w, h, gap, padding, alignItems, justifyContent, grow, backgroundColor.
  CONTENT nodes: <Text>, <Shape> - primitives that show things.
    <Text> supports inline children: <Span>, <B>, <I>, <U>, <S>.
    CRITICAL: inline tags and their surrounding text MUST be on the same line.
    A newline before or after an inline tag renders as a literal line break.
    CORRECT: <Text>$84.2<Span fontSize="20">M</Span></Text>  (one line)
    WRONG:   <Text>$84.2
               <Span fontSize="20">M</Span>
             </Text>  (newlines = extra rendered line breaks)
    Same rule applies inside <Li> and <Td>.
    <Shape> is always a LEAF - text goes in the text= attribute.
  DATA nodes (RIGID): <Chart>, <Table>, <Matrix>, <Timeline>, <ProcessArrow>,
    <Flow>, <Pyramid>, <Tree> - complex visualizations.
    These do NOT auto-size height. Every one MUST have w="max" + explicit pixel h.
  TEXT bands (AUTO-SIZE): A band containing ONLY Text, Ul/Li, Span, Shape
    — no rigid node inside. Do NOT set h; they auto-size to content.
  LIST nodes: <Ul>/<Li> (bullets), <Ol>/<Li> (numbered) - POM's native lists.

SIZING:
  w="max" / h="max" = flexGrow:1, fill remaining space along parent's main axis.
  w="62%" = explicit percentage of parent. Siblings should sum to ~100%.
  grow="2" = ratio split with siblings (grow="2" + grow="1" = 2:1).
  Fixed px (w="320") = only for elements that must not flex (icon, sidebar rail).

THEME TOKENS: Reference as $tokenName in color attributes (e.g. color="$textMain",
backgroundColor="$surfaceAlt"). Colors are 6-digit hex, NO # prefix.

